<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-019" chapter-id="c-nanshi-019-wangyongxian-caiqing" source-id="s-nanshi-019-wangyongxian-caiqing-ws1531762">
  <p id="c-nanshi-019-wangyongxian-caiqing:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">明年，<persName id="c-nanshi-019-wangyongxian-caiqing:p001:m0003" ref="aa6_83c_juy_CDAABA">超宗</persName>門生<persName id="c-nanshi-019-wangyongxian-caiqing:p001:m0007" ref="tfp_yjk_ts4">王永先</persName>又告<persName id="c-nanshi-019-wangyongxian-caiqing:p001:m0012" ref="aa6_83c_juy_CDAABA">超宗</persName>子<persName id="c-nanshi-019-wangyongxian-caiqing:p001:m0015" ref="aa6_83c_juy_CDAABAA">才卿</persName>死罪二十餘條。上疑<rs id="c-nanshi-019-wangyongxian-caiqing:p001:m0026" type="unresolved">其</rs>妄，以<persName id="c-nanshi-019-wangyongxian-caiqing:p001:m0030" ref="aa6_83c_juy_CDAABAA">才卿</persName>付廷尉辯，以不實見原。<persName id="c-nanshi-019-wangyongxian-caiqing:p001:m0043" ref="tfp_yjk_ts4">永先</persName>於獄盡<rs id="c-nanshi-019-wangyongxian-caiqing:p001:m0048" type="unresolved">之</rs>。</p>
</text>
